      "created_at": "2025-11-22T19:36:41.615Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/jaymez\">@jaymez</a></p>\n<p>The WHT requires to be mapped on Supplier as Withholding tax Category under tax tab break.</p>\n<p>The purchase tax template with first two lines will book vat and further contribution in the same table as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/4/848100438bec265491bcf8f38f625b10042b7ee5.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/848100438bec265491bcf8f38f625b10042b7ee5\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/4/848100438bec265491bcf8f38f625b10042b7ee5_2_646x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"iUbpof8Ouaad5njWxBgiHoS7Ce1\" width=\"646\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/4/848100438bec265491bcf8f38f625b10042b7ee5_2_646x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/8/4/848100438bec265491bcf8f38f625b10042b7ee5_2_969x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/4/848100438bec265491bcf8f38f625b10042b7ee5.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCF9EA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1189×920 63.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>This is going to be Accounting Impact as below;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/0/1/01837926ece6f2922d44476bd1cf3e5fb72ce2bf.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/01837926ece6f2922d44476bd1cf3e5fb72ce2bf\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/1/01837926ece6f2922d44476bd1cf3e5fb72ce2bf_2_690x256.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"do9LQR5P2GnQ5v6PDRgzOTWLg3\" width=\"690\" height=\"256\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/1/01837926ece6f2922d44476bd1cf3e5fb72ce2bf_2_690x256.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/1/01837926ece6f2922d44476bd1cf3e5fb72ce2bf_2_1035x384.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/1/01837926ece6f2922d44476bd1cf3e5fb72ce2bf_2_1380x512.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"DBDADA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1619×603 62.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>106.88 is the net payable in the name of supplier.</p>",
